            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The module describes the production of secondary copper in Germany with a production of 176'000 t copper cathodes in 1994. It is designed for the use of the metal as part of the consumption mix "copper, at regional storage". It is not to be used if the impact of the secondary copper is considerable. In such cases, a more detailed analysis has to be conducted.;
UUID: 72090602-835f-3db2-b0dc-61366408f8ab</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
