            <locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction location="RER" latitudeAndLongitude="55.895602991909776;28.119894957029818">
                <descriptionOfRestrictions xml:lang="en">This module is valid for one single very big plant, which is taken as proxy for the RER.</descriptionOfRestrictions>
            </locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction>
        </geography>
        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">In three different stages different types of copper scrap and 10% of the feed of blister copper are refined to copper cathodes. Waste water is led to a communal treatment plant.\n\n# Included processes\nThe module includes the collection and handling of the copper scrap, the refining and the processes for waste water treatment.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
